    narr:narration """This hub tracks the operationalization of [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), a foundational product differentiator established in March 2026. By August 2026, the narrative focus shifted from conceptual definition to empirical validation of delivery milestones. The trajectory is now anchored by the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785838678389_1) and the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785838678389_3), which is framed as a critical technical unlock. This transition is supported by [sprint-specific performance metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785838678389_2) that quantify the quarter's velocity as a marker of execution success. The [inquiry into delivery evidence](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryEvidence) serves as the ongoing bridge between the initial design intent and these recent technical milestones, framing the current state as a period of concrete, validated output.""" ;
